        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CF828/1/18 Decorative Appliance Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very decorative appliance handle is 18-1/2\" long and assembled in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions. Available in your choice of Oil Rubbed Bronze, Antique Brass, Satin Nickel or Polished Brass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Victorian design appliance pull is reminiscent of the late 1800's, very elaborate yet graceful, that embellished the european homes of the noble and wealthy. Can be used on metal, glass, composite or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions CF828/1/18 Decorative Appliance Handle \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Handle Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 16-5/8\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Handle Diameter (at center): 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Rosette Diameter: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Standard Finishes: 4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panels.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
